{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AlcheMice is a single-player Tactical Roguelike Deckbuilder</strong> that combines deck creation, turn-based combat, and strategic positioning on 3D boards. Set in a twisted and stylized version of 15th-century Granada, you play as Tycoh, an apprentice alchemist cursed by Gusparda, a dreadful witch who controls time through tarot cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through countless dungeons stretching across the city and the palaces of the Alhambra, intense battles, and narrative choices, you'll have to adapt your strategy, improve your deck, and master alchemy to break the three-day-and-night cycle that resets your world... although your deck and gear remain, making you stronger and stronger each time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/d4926ecc62da00f1a03b45a84fde1a81.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/d4926ecc62da00f1a03b45a84fde1a81.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/cartas.png?t=1769015887\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/9c60bdfc9160a6450f4b3b4c4e99babd.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/9c60bdfc9160a6450f4b3b4c4e99babd.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/8a62e5e89fa7416081b18484f3bc40ac.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1280 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from hundreds of cards and combine offensive, defensive, tactical, and alchemical effects to create unique synergies. Tailor your deck to your playstyle. Every run is different, and every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/6681c901cc13e72adb4b969c0598bd88.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/6681c901cc13e72adb4b969c0598bd88.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/4f0bfb62115a9348718918426634dd60.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1280 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, position, and strike in grid-based arenas with elevation and cover. Terrain isn\u2019t just scenery\u2014it\u2019s part of the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/47f1a9ec83b1a824b01d9d7459e33b19.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/47f1a9ec83b1a824b01d9d7459e33b19.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/55a69ec5d3d66e78cd0571297ae34b09.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1280 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather ingredients, learn recipes, and modify cards or attributes to counter evolving enemies that change with time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/c777cf4cbbd9bf7f06ecb69942cc6476.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/c777cf4cbbd9bf7f06ecb69942cc6476.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/8983731a031a92d3976ce51eced38509.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1280 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run begins with two tarot cards that reshape your powers and world rules. Some empower\u2026 others punish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the dawn of the fourth day, the world resets. But your knowledge, your deck, and some secrets stay with you. Learn to use them. When you return to the city, everything will have changed\u2014locations, enemies, and the loot you find...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/7a8980a83db00f45548945e3ccaa1463.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/7a8980a83db00f45548945e3ccaa1463.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/0d313b195a864ed0a9fff5311e6ee62e.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1280 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From crumbling castles to haunted markets, explore a Granada inspired by esoteric engravings, occult codices, and alchemical myths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/6839b61ed75b503f5a0cc6e8b1812d30.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1280 height=2413 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you break the curse\u2026 or become part of it?</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover it in AlcheMice.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3670110?t=1769015887","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/9e5df789a3ff976525d617992ddc5f44110ab15b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769015887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/f1d9b11a1329cdcba098349c0ceef88666b911dc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769015887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/f1d9b11a1329cdcba098349c0ceef88666b911dc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769015887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AlcheMice is a single-player Tactical Roguelike Deckbuilder</strong> that combines deck creation, turn-based combat, and strategic positioning on 3D boards. Set in a twisted and stylized version of 15th-century Granada, you play as Tycoh, an apprentice alchemist cursed by Gusparda, a dreadful witch who controls time through tarot cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through countless dungeons stretching across the city and the palaces of the Alhambra, intense battles, and narrative choices, you'll have to adapt your strategy, improve your deck, and master alchemy to break the three-day-and-night cycle that resets your world... although your deck and gear remain, making you stronger and stronger each time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/d4926ecc62da00f1a03b45a84fde1a81.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/d4926ecc62da00f1a03b45a84fde1a81.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/cartas.png?t=1769015887\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/9c60bdfc9160a6450f4b3b4c4e99babd.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/9c60bdfc9160a6450f4b3b4c4e99babd.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/8a62e5e89fa7416081b18484f3bc40ac.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1280 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from hundreds of cards and combine offensive, defensive, tactical, and alchemical effects to create unique synergies. Tailor your deck to your playstyle. Every run is different, and every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/6681c901cc13e72adb4b969c0598bd88.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/6681c901cc13e72adb4b969c0598bd88.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/4f0bfb62115a9348718918426634dd60.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1280 height=203 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move, position, and strike in grid-based arenas with elevation and cover. Terrain isn\u2019t just scenery\u2014it\u2019s part of the fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/47f1a9ec83b1a824b01d9d7459e33b19.poster.avif?t=1769015887\" width=1024 height=593 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/47f1a9ec83b1a824b01d9d7459e33b19.webm?t=1769015887\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670110/extras/55a69